                    "text": "It's a glorious gone",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "It's only time before they show me",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "Why no one ever comes back",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
